Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:46:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 10/18] feat(board): count-up score animation and '+N' flourish

Scores ease to their new value (700ms) with tabular numerals so digits don't
jump; increases show a short '+N' pill. prefers-reduced-motion jumps straight to
the value and only fades the pill. A timeout settles the final value even when
the game window's tab is in the background.
---
